# Silverquill, the Disputant gives casualty 1 to "each instant and sorcery spell you cast" (CR 702.153a, 604.1) and to no other spell.
# Bot1's Llanowar Elves, a creature spell cast with Silverquill on the battlefield, is asked nothing; its Lightning Bolt, an
# instant, is asked and the cost declined (the first answer): nothing is sacrificed and nothing copied, Bot2 loses 3 only.
# Bot2's own Lightning Bolt on its turn is asked nothing either: Silverquill is Bot1's, so it is not a spell Bot1 casts.
# Bot1 ends with the Elves and all it began with, 17 life.

